Z||000000||vinnywolfe||08-11-2000||07:58 PM||||sorry it took so long to get back with those of you that requested parts, but it took a couple of weeks to actually find time to make the trip.<BR>i am going to inventory everything and post it.  hpoefully later tonight.  i think i got most stuff that people wanted.  i am going back (hopefully tomorrow) to get quarter panels (notchback only) and window glass if enough people are interested.  i did see some good windows.  none of the infamous scratches found commonly on fieros.  i didn't have the tools with me last trip, and besides, there's no way i could've carried anymore stuff.<P>i'll keep you posted.<P>------------------<BR><p>[This message has been edited by vinnywolfe (edited 08-11-2000).]||||reg||1
