Z||000002||vinnywolfe||08-12-2000||10:52 PM||||ok guys, here's what i've dug out and cleaned up so far...<P>radio w/e.q.  radio works great, but belt is bad on tape player.  if you could get a new belt on cheap enough this would be a nice sounding stock stereo.  someone requested this radio, but i lost my list, so email me and let me know if you are still interested, whoever you were. <P> 4&6 cylinder dogbones w/ stock bushings (the bushings are in REAL good shape) i only have one of each left.  i bead blasted them and they cleaned up real nice.<P>85 gt black spoiler  real good shape, no sags.<P>85 gt black deck lid good shape except for small broken edge (where the decklid bolts to the support) which could be fixed.<P>decklid vents  also off 85 gt.  they are also in good shape.  not dented or broken.  paint faded (of course).  there are no screws for them, but i think the fiero store sells them.<P>2 power lock actuaters  i bench tested them and they worked. i think someone requested one of these.<P>wiper motor (delay type) i plugged this one into my harness on my car and it worked fine.<P>several gauge surround bezels (no scratches)<P>several defrost and trunk release switch assemblies<P>2 headlamp motors (from 85 gt). the old style.  i haven't had a chance to test them yet, but i will before i sell them.<P>i also have a good v6 engine from that 85 gt (minus the distributor.  i had to use it on my 87gt).  the front manifold was cracked, so i took it off, bead blasted it and had it welded.  i drove the car up onto and off of the dolly and it sounded great.  the cat had been replaced with a straight pipe. the car hit a pole and the damage was in the front end.  anyway, the engine is in the cradle and i already have the tranny promised to someone, but it is still in the cradle with the engine.  if someone is interested, i will pull them apart. i have the harness and computer from the car also. i'm not sure what it's worth, so if someone's interested, eamil me and we'll work something out.  by the way, the odometer on the car said 109,000.<P>i am planning another trip for quarter windows and glass.  any request's?<BR>   <BR><P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
